# Strength left the lead for Earthquake (37), and only the Marshtomp line learns Strength and Rock Smash in this party
# (src/data/pokemon/tmhm_learnsets.h: CASTFORM HM05 only, SWELLOW HM02 only), so a Linoone (tmhm_learnsets.h:6415:
# HM01, HM03, HM04, HM06) joins as the HM carrier for Victory Road's boulders and rocks; the lead keeps Dive (the way
# out of Sootopolis) and Surf, and takes HM07 Waterfall (Cave of Origin B3F item ball, 36) in place of Rock Smash for
# Ever Grande's falls (EverGrandeCity map.json: MB_WATERFALL (16..27, 60..67) below Victory Road). Wally (pokeruby gTrainerParty_Wally1: ALTARIA 44 .. GARDEVOIR 45) and Victory Road's
# lv 40+ trainers: the level carries the lead.
party-move 0 3 MOVE_WATERFALL
party-level 0 70
party SPECIES_LINOONE 50 ITEM_NONE
party-move 3 0 MOVE_STRENGTH
party-move 3 1 MOVE_ROCK_SMASH
party-move 3 2 MOVE_CUT
party-move 3 3 MOVE_SURF
item ITEM_FULL_RESTORE 10
